#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: dynamic-tags-for-elementor.php
msgid "Dynamic Tags for Elementor"
msgstr "Dynamische Tags fur Elementor"

#. Description of the plugin
#: dynamic-tags-for-elementor.php
msgid ""
"Enables dynamic tag functionality for the free version of Elementor and "
"allows creating custom tags."
msgstr ""
"Aktiviert dynamische Tag-Funktionen fur die kostenlose Version von Elementor "
"und ermoglicht das Erstellen benutzerdefinierter Tags."

#. Author of the plugin
#: dynamic-tags-for-elementor.php
msgid "Md Mustafa Kamal Hossain"
msgstr "Md Mustafa Kamal Hossain"

#: dynamic-tags-for-elementor.php:139
msgid ""
"Dynamic Tags for Elementor requires Elementor to be installed and active."
msgstr ""
"Dynamic Tags for Elementor erfordert, dass Elementor installiert und aktiv "
"ist."

